#: kcalc.cpp:2146
msgid "Built with %1 bit (long double) precision"
msgstr "Copilé avou ene sipepieusté di %1 bit (long double)"

#: kcalc.cpp:2149
msgid ""
"Built with %1 bit precision\n"
"\n"
"Note: Due to a broken C library, KCalc's precision \n"
"was conditionally reduced at compile time from\n"
"'long double' to 'double'. \n"
"\n"
"Owners of systems with a working libc may \n"
"want to recompile KCalc with 'long double' \n"
"precision enabled. See the README for details."
msgstr ""
"Copilé avou ene sipepieusté di %1 bit\n"
"\n"
"Note: a cåze d' ene crombe livreye C, li spepieusté\n"
"di KCalc a stî rastrindowe si «long double» a «double»\n"
"å moumint do copilaedje.\n"
"\n"
"Les cis / cenes k' ont ene éndjole avou ene libc\n"
"ki va duvrént rcopiler KCalc tot metant en ouve\n"
" li spepieusté avou «long double». Alez loukî e fitchî\n"
"README po vey cwè."

